spice
* SPICE Netlist for the Circuit

* Voltage Sources
VBIAS1 6 0 DC <value>
VBIAS2 4 0 DC <value>

* MOSFETs
M1 4 VIN+ 6 6 NMOS
M2 4 VIN- 6 6 NMOS
M3 5 2 3 3 PMOS
M4 4 2 3 3 PMOS

* Please replace `<value>` with the DC voltage values for VBIAS1 and VBIAS2.
* Assume NMOS and PMOS models are defined elsewhere in the library.

* End of Netlist